{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Tickbuddy\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "frontend-url-without-route",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "src/strictHandling.test.ts:25 /ocs/v2.php/apps/tickbuddy/apifoo"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The frontend or a template builds 1 URL below /apps/tickbuddy/ that no route of the app matches. The request fails at run time.",
        "  src/strictHandling.test.ts:25 /ocs/v2.php/apps/tickbuddy/apifoo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/ImportService.php:65",
        "lib/Service/ImportService.php:159"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Service/ImportService.php:65",
        "  lib/Service/ImportService.php:159"
      ]
    },
